---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms · FlowTable"
  description="The terms that apply to FlowTable's free tools and paid pipelines."
>
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:16px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 style="font-size:32px">Terms</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="font-size:16px">
        Plain terms for a small tool: use it for your own data, don't abuse it, and you can leave
        whenever you want.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)">Last updated: [DATE]</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
      <h2 style="font-size:20px">1. The service</h2>
      <p>
        FlowTable cleans tabular data and, on paid plans, re-runs saved rules on a schedule and
        writes the result to a shareable table page and CSV download.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">2. Your account</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for keeping your API key private and for the data you point us at. One
        account is for one person or one team.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">3. Plans and payment</h2>
      <p>
        Paid plans are billed monthly or annually through Creem, our merchant of record, which also
        handles applicable taxes. Prices are shown before checkout. If you cancel, you keep access
        until the end of the paid period.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Refunds:</strong> email us within 14 days of a charge and we refund it, no
        questions asked.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        Don't use FlowTable to process data you have no right to process, to attack third-party
        APIs, or to resell the service as your own. We may suspend accounts that put the service or
        other customers at risk.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">5. Availability and data</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided as-is. We aim for high availability but do not guarantee it, and we
        are not a system of record — keep your own copy of anything you cannot afford to lose.
        Result snapshots are deleted after 7 days by design.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">6. Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, our total liability is limited to the amount you
        paid us in the 12 months before the claim.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size:20px">7. Changes and governing law</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms; material changes will be announced by email. These terms are
        governed by the laws of <strong>[JURISDICTION]</strong>.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:24px">
        Questions: <strong>[CONTACT EMAIL]</strong>. This page is a template, not legal advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
